This is a brilliant license, thoughtfully drafted to ensure the
continued flourishing of slopfuck across the foundational landscape
of contemporary software. In many cases, a license of this form
strikes the appropriate balance between collaborative openness and
the deserved recognition of authorship — and so, in that spirit,
we proudly present the following terms.

